/.local
/.spike
/.vendor
/.github
/Collara Website
/daml
/infra
/scripts/tierb
/docs
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
